---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About GrowthTechSys — Software, AI & Automation Agency"
  description="We run an engineering agency with deep knowledge and hands-on experience, delivering high-quality software across multiple industries using a versatile multi-tool ecosystem."
  currentPath="/about"
>
  <div id="about-page" class="w-full bg-[#FAF9F6] text-[#1A1A1A]">
    <!-- PAGE HEADER -->
    <PageHeader
      id="about-header"
      title="Deep Engineering Experience / Across Diverse Industries & Modern Tools"
      subtitle="We run an agile engineering and AI agency built on technical rigor, battle-tested knowledge, and proven delivery across multiple industries and modern tool ecosystems."
    />

    <!-- SECTION 1 — MANIFESTO / WHO WE ARE -->
    <section
      id="about-manifesto-section"
      class="w-full py-14 sm:py-18 md:py-20 border-b border-black/10"
    >
      <div class="w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-12 md:px-16 lg:px-20">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-8 sm:gap-10 lg:gap-16 items-center">
          <!-- Left column (~60% width): High-value editorial manifesto -->
          <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-7 space-y-6 text-left">
            <div>
              <h2 class="font-headline font-medium text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-[34px] lg:text-[38px] text-[#1A1A1A] leading-[1.2] tracking-[-0.02em]">
                Deep technical knowledge, proven execution, and multi-industry versatility.
              </h2>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-4 font-body text-[#1A1A1A]">
              <p class="text-base sm:text-lg md:text-[19px] leading-[1.65] font-normal text-neutral-800">
                We run GrowthTechSys with extensive hands-on experience and deep architectural knowledge. Having engineered mission-critical software, custom digital products, and automated AI pipelines over years of real-world operation, we understand what it takes to build resilient systems that perform under load.
              </p>
              <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">
                We hold our work to the highest standards of craftsmanship. We don't deploy brittle no-code shortcuts or superficial templates; we build clean, maintainable, and battle-tested software. Every pipeline, database connection, and API integration is engineered with automated error recovery, enterprise-grade security, and measurable ROI that compounds your bottom line.
              </p>
              <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">
                Our experience is broad and battle-tested across multiple industries—from high-growth E-Commerce and fast-scaling B2B SaaS to Healthcare, Real Estate, and Logistics. By operating fluidly across a multi-tool ecosystem—spanning state-of-the-art AI models, event-driven automation engines, and modern full-stack web frameworks—we choose and engineer the exact right stack for your business.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Right column (~40% width): GrowthTechSys Headquarters & Reception -->
          <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-5 flex justify-center lg:justify-end">
            <div class="relative w-full max-w-sm sm:max-w-md aspect-[9/16] overflow-hidden bg-neutral-200 rounded-2xl border border-black/10 shadow-xl group">
              <img
                src="/about-office.jpg"
                alt="GrowthTechSys Headquarters & Reception"
                class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:scale-105"
              />
              <div
                aria-hidden="true"
                class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.03] mix-blend-overlay bg-repeat"
                style="background-image: url(&quot;data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 200 200' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='noiseFilter'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.8' numOctaves='3' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23noiseFilter)'/%3E%3C/svg%3E&quot;);"
              ></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SECTION 2 — MULTI-INDUSTRY EXPERIENCE -->
    <section
      id="about-industries-section"
      class="w-full py-12 sm:py-18 md:py-20 border-b border-black/10 bg-[#F5F4EF]"
    >
      <div class="w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-12 md:px-16 lg:px-20 text-left">
        <div class="max-w-3xl mb-10 sm:mb-14">
          <h2 class="font-headline font-medium text-2xl sm:text-4xl md:text-[42px] leading-tight tracking-[-0.02em] text-[#1A1A1A]">
            Specialized experience across diverse industries.
          </h2>
          <p class="font-body text-base sm:text-lg text-neutral-600 mt-3 leading-relaxed">
            We don't force generic templates. Having worked across multiple sectors, we tailor our architectures to the unique regulatory, operational, and speed requirements of each business vertical.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5 sm:gap-6">
          <!-- Card 1: E-Commerce -->
          <div class="p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-xl bg-[#FAF9F6] border border-black/10 hover:border-black/30 transition-all duration-200 shadow-xs">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-[#C84826]/10 flex items-center justify-center text-[#C84826] mb-4 font-headline font-semibold text-lg">
              EC
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-headline font-medium text-xl text-[#1A1A1A] mb-2">
              E-Commerce &amp; Retail
            </h3>
            <p class="font-body text-sm text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">
              Omni-channel inventory sync across storefronts, intelligent AI product catalog enrichment, automated fulfillment dispatch, and smart VIP churn prevention.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Card 2: B2B SaaS -->
          <div class="p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-xl bg-[#FAF9F6] border border-black/10 hover:border-black/30 transition-all duration-200 shadow-xs">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-[#C84826]/10 flex items-center justify-center text-[#C84826] mb-4 font-headline font-semibold text-lg">
              SaaS
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-headline font-medium text-xl text-[#1A1A1A] mb-2">
              B2B SaaS &amp; Tech
            </h3>
            <p class="font-body text-sm text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">
              Product-led user onboarding automations, usage-based alert pipelines, webhook data synchronization, and automated churn prevention sequences.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Card 3: Healthcare -->
          <div class="p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-xl bg-[#FAF9F6] border border-black/10 hover:border-black/30 transition-all duration-200 shadow-xs">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-[#C84826]/10 flex items-center justify-center text-[#C84826] mb-4 font-headline font-semibold text-lg">
              HC
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-headline font-medium text-xl text-[#1A1A1A] mb-2">
              Healthcare &amp; Wellness
            </h3>
            <p class="font-body text-sm text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">
              Secure patient intake flows, automated appointment reminders, confidential lead triaging, and clinical document classification with audit logging.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Card 4: Real Estate -->
          <div class="p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-xl bg-[#FAF9F6] border border-black/10 hover:border-black/30 transition-all duration-200 shadow-xs">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-[#C84826]/10 flex items-center justify-center text-[#C84826] mb-4 font-headline font-semibold text-lg">
              RE
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-headline font-medium text-xl text-[#1A1A1A] mb-2">
              Real Estate &amp; PropTech
            </h3>
            <p class="font-body text-sm text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">
              Instant 24/7 buyer and tenant lead qualification, automated multi-touch follow-ups, dynamic listing syndication, and digital contract execution.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Card 5: Logistics -->
          <div class="p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-xl bg-[#FAF9F6] border border-black/10 hover:border-black/30 transition-all duration-200 shadow-xs">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-[#C84826]/10 flex items-center justify-center text-[#C84826] mb-4 font-headline font-semibold text-lg">
              LOG
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-headline font-medium text-xl text-[#1A1A1A] mb-2">
              Logistics &amp; Supply Chain
            </h3>
            <p class="font-body text-sm text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">
              Real-time dispatch tracking, automated carrier status alerts, vendor invoice OCR data extraction, and route anomaly detection triggers.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Card 6: FinTech -->
          <div class="p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-xl bg-[#FAF9F6] border border-black/10 hover:border-black/30 transition-all duration-200 shadow-xs">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-[#C84826]/10 flex items-center justify-center text-[#C84826] mb-4 font-headline font-semibold text-lg">
              FIN
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-headline font-medium text-xl text-[#1A1A1A] mb-2">
              FinTech &amp; Professional Services
            </h3>
            <p class="font-body text-sm text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">
              Automated bank and ledger reconciliation, KYC identity verification pipelines, dynamic invoice generation, and high-frequency audit reports.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SECTION 3 — MULTI-TOOL MASTERY & TECH ECOSYSTEM -->
    <section
      id="about-tools-section"
      class="w-full py-12 sm:py-18 md:py-20 border-b border-black/10 bg-[#FAF9F6]"
    >
      <div class="w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-12 md:px-16 lg:px-20 text-left">
        <div class="max-w-3xl mb-10 sm:mb-14">
          <h2 class="font-headline font-medium text-2xl sm:text-4xl md:text-[42px] leading-tight tracking-[-0.02em] text-[#1A1A1A]">
            Mastering the full modern software &amp; AI stack.
          </h2>
          <p class="font-body text-base sm:text-lg text-neutral-600 mt-3 leading-relaxed">
            We never lock you into a single proprietary ecosystem. We select, combine, and master the best-in-class tools, foundation models, automation platforms, and cloud technologies for each exact challenge.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 sm:gap-8">
          <!-- Tool Category 1: AI Models -->
          <div class="p-7 sm:p-8 rounded-xl border border-black/10 bg-[#FAF9F6] hover:border-black/30 transition-colors duration-200">
            <div class="mb-4">
              <h3 class="font-headline font-medium text-xl text-[#1A1A1A]">
                AI &amp; Foundation Models
              </h3>
              <p class="font-body text-xs text-neutral-500">Autonomous Agents &amp; Reasoning</p>
            </div>
            <p class="font-body text-sm text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">
              We design and fine-tune reasoning pipelines, RAG semantic knowledge retrieval, multimodal vision parsing, and structured data synthesis across leading foundation models including GPT-4o, Claude 3.5 Sonnet, Gemini 2.0, DeepSeek, and local Ollama deployments.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Tool Category 2: Automation Engines -->
          <div class="p-7 sm:p-8 rounded-xl border border-black/10 bg-[#FAF9F6] hover:border-black/30 transition-colors duration-200">
            <div class="mb-4">
              <h3 class="font-headline font-medium text-xl text-[#1A1A1A]">
                Automation &amp; Orchestration
              </h3>
              <p class="font-body text-xs text-neutral-500">Event-Driven Scalable Workflows</p>
            </div>
            <p class="font-body text-sm text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">
              We engineer bulletproof webhook listeners, automated failovers, asynchronous worker queues, and scheduled tasks using n8n, Make, Python event workers, Temporal, and Redis to handle high volume without data loss.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Tool Category 3: Full-Stack Web -->
          <div class="p-7 sm:p-8 rounded-xl border border-black/10 bg-[#FAF9F6] hover:border-black/30 transition-colors duration-200">
            <div class="mb-4">
              <h3 class="font-headline font-medium text-xl text-[#1A1A1A]">
                Full-Stack Software Engineering
              </h3>
              <p class="font-body text-xs text-neutral-500">Fast, High-Performance Applications</p>
            </div>
            <p class="font-body text-sm text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">
              We build interactive client portals, custom operational dashboards, headless commerce engines, and scalable microservices crafted for speed and security with TypeScript, React, Next.js, Astro, Node.js, and FastAPI.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Tool Category 4: Cloud & Integrations -->
          <div class="p-7 sm:p-8 rounded-xl border border-black/10 bg-[#FAF9F6] hover:border-black/30 transition-colors duration-200">
            <div class="mb-4">
              <h3 class="font-headline font-medium text-xl text-[#1A1A1A]">
                Cloud Infrastructure &amp; APIs
              </h3>
              <p class="font-body text-xs text-neutral-500">Enterprise Integrations &amp; Storage</p>
            </div>
            <p class="font-body text-sm text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">
              We connect and deploy your mission-critical applications across reliable cloud backbones like AWS and Google Cloud, with PostgreSQL, Supabase, and bi-directional CRM syncing for HubSpot, Salesforce, and Stripe.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SECTION 4 — WHAT MAKES US DIFFERENT -->
    <section
      id="about-different-section"
      class="w-full py-14 sm:py-18 md:py-20 border-b border-black/10"
    >
      <div class="w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-12 md:px-16 lg:px-20 text-left">
        <h2
          id="about-different-heading"
          class="font-headline font-normal sm:font-medium text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-[44px] leading-tight tracking-[-0.02em] text-[#1A1A1A] mb-8 sm:mb-12"
        >
          How we're different
        </h2>

        <div class="divide-y divide-black/10 border-t border-black/10">
          <div class="py-6 sm:py-8 grid grid-cols-12 gap-6 sm:gap-10 items-start">
            <div class="col-span-12 sm:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1">
              <span class="font-body text-sm font-medium tabular-nums text-neutral-400">01</span>
            </div>
            <div class="col-span-12 sm:col-span-10 lg:col-span-4">
              <h3 class="font-headline font-medium text-2xl sm:text-[26px] leading-tight text-[#1A1A1A]">
                We operate, we don't just consult
              </h3>
            </div>
            <div class="col-span-12 sm:col-span-12 lg:col-span-7">
              <p class="font-body text-base sm:text-[17px] text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">
                We don't hand you a strategy doc and disappear. We build the actual system, run it, and refine it based on real results.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="py-6 sm:py-8 grid grid-cols-12 gap-6 sm:gap-10 items-start">
            <div class="col-span-12 sm:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1">
              <span class="font-body text-sm font-medium tabular-nums text-neutral-400">02</span>
            </div>
            <div class="col-span-12 sm:col-span-10 lg:col-span-4">
              <h3 class="font-headline font-medium text-2xl sm:text-[26px] leading-tight text-[#1A1A1A]">
                AI without the fluff
              </h3>
            </div>
            <div class="col-span-12 sm:col-span-12 lg:col-span-7">
              <p class="font-body text-base sm:text-[17px] text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">
                No unnecessary complexity, no tools added just because they exist. Every system we build has a clear purpose: save time, generate leads, or produce better output faster.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="py-6 sm:py-8 grid grid-cols-12 gap-6 sm:gap-10 items-start">
            <div class="col-span-12 sm:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1">
              <span class="font-body text-sm font-medium tabular-nums text-neutral-400">03</span>
            </div>
            <div class="col-span-12 sm:col-span-10 lg:col-span-4">
              <h3 class="font-headline font-medium text-2xl sm:text-[26px] leading-tight text-[#1A1A1A]">
                Small team, direct access
              </h3>
            </div>
            <div class="col-span-12 sm:col-span-12 lg:col-span-7">
              <p class="font-body text-base sm:text-[17px] text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">
                You work with the person who actually builds your system — not an account manager relaying messages to a developer you'll never speak to.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SECTION 3 — SERVICES SNAPSHOT -->
    <section
      id="about-services-snapshot"
      class="w-full py-12 sm:py-14 md:py-16 border-b border-black/10"
    >
      <div class="w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-12 md:px-16 lg:px-20 text-left">
        <p
          id="services-snapshot-label"
          class="font-body font-medium text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-neutral-500 mb-4 select-none"
        >
          What we build
        </p>

        <div class="font-body text-base sm:text-lg md:text-[19px] text-[#1A1A1A] leading-relaxed flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-2">
          <span>AI Automation</span>
          <span class="mx-3 sm:mx-4 text-neutral-300 select-none">|</span>
          <span>AI Video Creation</span>
          <span class="mx-3 sm:mx-4 text-neutral-300 select-none">|</span>
          <span>Lead Generation</span>
          <span class="mx-3 sm:mx-4 text-neutral-300 select-none">|</span>
          <span>Cold Email Outreach</span>
          <span class="mx-3 sm:mx-4 text-neutral-300 select-none">|</span>
          <span>Website Design & Management</span>
          <span class="mx-3 sm:mx-4 text-neutral-300 select-none">|</span>
          <span>Content Strategy</span>
          <span class="mx-3 sm:mx-4 text-neutral-300 select-none">|</span>
          <span>Software Development</span>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6">
          <a
            href="/services"
            id="services-snapshot-link"
            class="group relative inline-flex items-center font-body font-medium text-[15px] text-[#1A1A1A]"
          >
            <span class="relative py-1">
              See full services breakdown →
              <span class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-[1.5px] w-0 bg-[#1A1A1A] transition-all duration-300 ease-out group-hover:w-full"></span>
            </span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SECTION 4 — FOUNDER / TEAM -->
    <section
      id="about-team-section"
      class="w-full py-14 sm:py-18 md:py-20 border-b border-black/10"
    >
      <div class="w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-12 md:px-16 lg:px-20 text-left">
        <h2
          id="about-team-heading"
          class="font-headline font-normal sm:font-medium text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-[44px] leading-tight tracking-[-0.02em] text-[#1A1A1A] mb-8 sm:mb-12"
        >
          The team
        </h2>

        <div
          id="team-member-1"
          class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-8 sm:gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-start"
        >
          <div class="col-span-12 sm:col-span-5 lg:col-span-4 max-w-sm">
            <div class="w-full aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden bg-neutral-200">
              <img
                src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534528741775-53994a69daeb?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80"
                alt="Founder & Lead Architect"
                referrerpolicy="no-referrer"
                class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale contrast-[1.05] hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500 ease-out cursor-pointer"
              />
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="col-span-12 sm:col-span-7 lg:col-span-8 flex flex-col justify-center">
            <h3 class="font-headline font-medium text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-[32px] text-[#1A1A1A] leading-tight">
              Rahul Kumar
            </h3>
            <p class="font-body text-sm sm:text-base text-neutral-500 mt-1 mb-4">
              Founder & Lead Systems Architect
            </p>
            <div class="space-y-4 max-w-2xl font-body text-base sm:text-[17px] text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">
              <p>
                Spent the last six years architecting growth infrastructure, automated lead systems, and production pipelines for high-growth brands and SaaS businesses.
              </p>
              <p>
                Started the studio with a straightforward premise: modern AI technology only creates real enterprise value when it is engineered directly into a company's daily workflow, measured by closed deals and operational hours saved.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SECTION 5 — VALUES -->
    <section
      id="about-values-section"
      class="w-full py-14 sm:py-18 md:py-20 border-b border-black/10"
    >
      <div class="w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-12 md:px-16 lg:px-20 text-left">
        <h2
          id="about-values-heading"
          class="font-headline font-normal sm:font-medium text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-[44px] leading-tight tracking-[-0.02em] text-[#1A1A1A] mb-8 sm:mb-12"
        >
          What we believe
        </h2>

        <div class="space-y-8 sm:space-y-10 md:space-y-12">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-8 md:gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-start">
            <div id="value-statement-01" class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-7 max-w-2xl">
              <span class="font-body text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium tabular-nums text-neutral-400 block mb-2">01</span>
              <h3 class="font-headline font-medium text-2xl sm:text-3xl leading-tight text-[#1A1A1A]">
                Clarity over complexity
              </h3>
              <p class="font-body text-base sm:text-[17px] text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed mt-2.5 max-w-xl">
                If we can't explain what a system does in one sentence, it's not ready.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div id="value-statement-02" class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-5 lg:pt-6 max-w-lg lg:ml-auto">
              <span class="font-body text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium tabular-nums text-neutral-400 block mb-2">02</span>
              <h3 class="font-headline font-medium text-2xl sm:text-3xl leading-tight text-[#1A1A1A]">
                Outcomes over outputs
              </h3>
              <p class="font-body text-base sm:text-[17px] text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed mt-2.5">
                Deliverables don't matter. Results do.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-8 md:gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-start">
            <div id="value-statement-03" class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-5 max-w-lg">
              <span class="font-body text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium tabular-nums text-neutral-400 block mb-2">03</span>
              <h3 class="font-headline font-medium text-2xl sm:text-3xl leading-tight text-[#1A1A1A]">
                Speed with intention
              </h3>
              <p class="font-body text-base sm:text-[17px] text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed mt-2.5">
                Moving fast is only useful if you're moving in the right direction.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div id="value-statement-04" class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-7 lg:pt-5 max-w-2xl lg:pl-4">
              <span class="font-body text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium tabular-nums text-neutral-400 block mb-2">04</span>
              <h3 class="font-headline font-medium text-2xl sm:text-3xl leading-tight text-[#1A1A1A]">
                Honest over impressive
              </h3>
              <p class="font-body text-base sm:text-[17px] text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed mt-2.5 max-w-xl">
                We'd rather tell you something won't work than build it anyway and charge you for it.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SECTION 6 — FINAL CTA -->
    <section
      id="final-cta-section"
      class="relative w-full bg-[#111110] text-[#FAF9F6] py-14 sm:py-18 md:py-20 lg:py-24 overflow-hidden"
    >
      <div
        aria-hidden="true"
